### 1. Get all products
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products
Authorization: Basic ZGV2dXNlcjpDaG9vc2VZb3VyT3duTG9jYWxQYXNzd29yZDEyMyE=
WWW-Authenticate: Basic realm="Realm", charset="UTF-8"
X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
X-XSS-Protection: 0
Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, max-age=0, must-revalidate
Pragma: no-cache
Expires: 0
X-Frame-Options: DENY
Set-Cookie: JSESSIONID=8269B52A1E786D2857BD192A5BC70D8D; Path=/; HttpOnly
Content-Length: 0
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 14:44:22 GMT
Connection: close


###

### 2. Add a new product
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Authorization: Basic ZGV2dXNlcjpDaG9vc2VZb3VyT3duTG9jYWxQYXNzd29yZDEyMyE=
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Test Mouse",
    "category": "Electronics",
    "quantity": 3,
    "price": 450.00,
    "minimumStock": 10
}

###

### 3. Get a product by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Authorization: Basic ZGV2dXNlcjpDaG9vc2VZb3VyT3duTG9jYWxQYXNzd29yZDEyMyE=

###

### 4. Update a product
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Authorization: Basic ZGV2dXNlcjpDaG9vc2VZb3VyT3duTG9jYWxQYXNzd29yZDEyMyE=
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Notebook",
    "category": "Stationery",
    "quantity": 75,
    "price": 45.00,
    "minimumStock": 15
}

###

### 5. Delete a product
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Authorization: Basic ZGV2dXNlcjpDaG9vc2VZb3VyT3duTG9jYWxQYXNzd29yZDEyMyE=

### Get low-stock products
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/low-stock
Authorization: Basic ZGV2dXNlcjpDaG9vc2VZb3VyT3duTG9jYWxQYXNzd29yZDEyMyE=